# Windows NTFS alternate data streams. Downloading any file with a Windows
# browser leaves a sibling `<name>:Zone.Identifier` stub next to it, visible
# from WSL as a real 25-byte file. `docs/ROADMAP.md:Zone.Identifier` reached
# the index that way (removed in step 6). The whole class is ignored, not
# that one path -- the next downloaded file would produce the next one.
*:Zone.Identifier

# Data / runtime
*.log

# Coverage output. `.coverage` is a local SQLite database rewritten by every
# `pytest --cov` run; it was tracked until step 6 and committed binary churn.
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/

# TLS material for the local edge — generated by the nginx-certs one-shot
# service (7.3). Never committed: development keys, and a real deployment
# mounts its own.
deploy/nginx/certs/
